WEBVTT

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:14.590
...We're going to perform on stage...

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:17.160
Scouted for a concert
on our first day as idols!

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.720
Who knows what'll happen next?

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:21.910
Man, isn't being an idol awesome?

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:22.920
Yeah!

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:25.480
What do you think, Rin?

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:30.760
It still doesn't feel real to me.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:33.860
I can't really imagine myself on stage.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:41.370
Is this how idols are
supposed to make their start?

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:46.620
...I don't know if it is, but...

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:49.630
We won't know until we try!

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:53.130
That hurt.

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:56.470
...Good morn—

00:00:57.430 --> 00:00:58.470
—ing?

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:03.880
Meow can a bunch of meowcomers who came
after us get a chance to go on stage before meow?

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:06.390
We'll see who <i>really</i> deserves that chance!

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:07.980
Fight meow!

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:53.500
That was pretty intense.

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:57.820
I was testing meowself with that one!

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:59.420
I didn't lose to you!

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:01.160
Meow!

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:03.550
What's this have to do with being an idol?

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:11.360
Miku, are you okay?

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:13.650
...U-Um...

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:19.400
I made some cream puffs
to celebrate your first time on stage.

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:22.240
Wow!

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:24.130
Thank you so much!

00:03:24.130 --> 00:03:25.170
You're very welcome.

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.080
They're delicious!

00:03:32.470 --> 00:03:34.710
You made these yourself? Wow!

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:38.420
Here, have some.

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:41.550
Thanks.

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:47.140
They're good.

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:49.510
Eat as much as you'd like.

00:03:49.890 --> 00:03:51.310
I made plenty more.

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:52.720
Really?!

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:52.720
Can we?!

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:53.330
...Um...

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:53.730
Yay!

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:55.700
Thank you so much!

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:57.370
...And one for me...

00:03:58.480 --> 00:03:59.570
Hold it!

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:01.110
Mimura!

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:02.570
You're an idol.

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:05.930
You'd better start watching your weight.

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:07.570
I-I'm sorry!

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:09.820
For Pete's sake.

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:11.830
Has anyone seen Jougasaki?

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:14.540
Morning!

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:16.440
Jougasaki Mika!

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:18.430
...Miss.

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:20.130
Good morning.

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:21.510
Sorry I'm late!

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:23.030
My interview ran a bit over.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:25.050
Whatever. Just get changed.

00:04:25.050 --> 00:04:26.380
Okay.

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:33.180
A dance lesson with <i>the</i> Jougasaki Mika!

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:36.950
You show them the ropes first.

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:38.850
Once they get the hang of it, I'll take over.

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:39.670
Sure.

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:42.150
Have you guys danced before?

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:45.010
I danced with my school friends a lot!

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.340
I-I attended an art school.

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:49.540
I can't say I have.

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:52.640
But I watched your concert DVDs
and learned the steps.

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:54.230
...I see...

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:56.540
Well, we won't know until you try.

00:04:57.200 --> 00:04:59.830
I'll have you guys dancing in no time!

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.540
...Mika...

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:04.260
I'll call you Sis from now on!

00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:06.080
S-Sis?

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:07.770
One, two, three, four,

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:09.640
five, six, seven, eight!

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:12.760
It looks really cool if you
land the pose and just hold it.

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:16.710
...I-I'm dying...

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:19.290
...Um...

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:21.480
There's a part I didn't really catch.

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:23.060
Which part?

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:24.360
...Um...

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:29.630
My excitement escalates all the way up.

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:33.360
I'm in love mode and
ready to pop like cider.

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:34.490
Around here.

00:05:34.490 --> 00:05:36.790
Wow! You can sing too!

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:38.150
Awesome, Shiburin!

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:39.580
Rin, you're so cool!

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:42.150
Th-That doesn't matter right now.

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:44.960
Oh? Is Shiburin turning Shyburin?

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:47.010
I wonder what they'll wear at the concert.

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:46.020
No, I'm not.

00:05:46.020 --> 00:05:48.640
Come on, just admit it.

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:48.190
...The concert...

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:50.780
Yeah, you're good!

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:51.520
I'm getting nervous just thinking about it.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:51.520
...So, about that part...

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:53.720
...Right, so I didn't catch exactly—

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:56.930
Just a meowment!

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:59.640
The last game was only a fluke!

00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:01.860
...Fight meow again—

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:05.050
There's something <i>else</i>
that <i>you</i> should be doing.

00:06:10.150 --> 00:06:11.990
Thank you for the lesson!

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:13.910
See you guys later!

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:29.840
Penny for your thoughts?

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:32.760
Oh, no.

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:36.850
Worried about them being backup dancers?

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:40.130
Yes.

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:44.150
I think they all have potential.

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:48.650
But I don't think they're ready yet.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:51.010
You might be right about that.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:58.540
But don't you think this might
be good experience for them?

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:09.520
These look new.

00:07:10.670 --> 00:07:12.680
Oh, these were from the winter concert!

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:14.460
Wow!

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:16.810
Hey, hey, Shimamu! Look!

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:21.640
...You shouldn't be touching them...

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:23.610
What? Why not?

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:28.820
Huh?

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:31.100
The dance... instructor?

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:33.700
Her little sister.

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:35.500
Wow! You look just like her!

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:37.640
We get that a lot.

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:44.270
I'm a dance instructor too,
but I'm still new.

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:47.880
So you're a rookie like us?

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:49.130
...Rookie...

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:51.920
Mind if I call you Rookie, then?

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:54.300
Huh? Rookie?

00:07:59.180 --> 00:08:01.980
Whoa, I look kinda sexy.

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:06.710
You two look great!

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:07.980
You too, Shimamu!

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:10.040
Like you turned into an idol overnight!

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:11.120
Really?!

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:13.630
Please check how well they fit.

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:14.300
Okay!

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:16.870
...Um...

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:18.240
...This part back here...

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:20.480
You're wearing them already?

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:22.050
Are those your outfits for the concert?

00:08:22.050 --> 00:08:23.340
Wow! Wow!

00:08:23.340 --> 00:08:28.500
But don't you think they'd be sexier
if you showed your entire stomach?

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:29.380
Huh?

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:29.380
Hm...

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:30.090
Meow!

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:32.760
Fight meow for those costumes!

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:35.090
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:08:35.090 --> 00:08:36.750
Look thataway!

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:37.260
Oh.

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:38.300
I win!

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:39.900
You're amazing, Mio!

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:41.260
That didn't cmeownt!

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:45.230
Luck is a skill, right?

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:46.890
...five, six, seven, eight!...

00:08:46.890 --> 00:08:48.350
One, two, three, four,

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:48.350
Okay, break!

00:08:48.350 --> 00:08:49.930
five, six, seven, eight!

00:08:49.930 --> 00:08:51.510
One, two, three, four,

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:52.280
You guys are next.

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:53.070
five, six, seven, eight!

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:54.970
Maekawa! Get over it already!

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:54.970
Turn! Okay!

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.490
Yes.

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:57.610
Two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight!

00:08:57.610 --> 00:08:59.190
One, two, three, four,

00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:00.760
five, six, seven, eight!

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:02.120
One, two, three, four,

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:03.890
five, six, seven, eight!

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:04.370
...One...

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:06.250
Here you go, Anya.

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:10.460
Spasibo.

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:11.190
Oh.

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:12.840
...Um...

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:14.940
Thank you, Minami.

00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:22.420
Minami, they are doing the overwork,
don't you are thinking?

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:25.680
The concert's just around the corner,
so they have to practice hard.

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:52.440
...One, two, three, four—

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:53.850
Relax those hips!

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:55.420
Arms out wider!

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:04.760
They're workin' real hard in there!

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:09.630
Sorry, did you say something?

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:13.900
Riina, d'dya wanna
go on stage with Mika too?

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:19.400
Being an idol's backup dancer's
totally not rockin'.

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:22.230
You think so?

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:26.460
O, young virgins, chosen for your externs,

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:28.900
shed now the waters of youthful life,

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:31.130
in preparation for the feast-battle at hand.

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:39.510
Meanwhile, I shall rest my
wings of darkness for the time to come.

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:45.370
Huh?

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:48.290
Oh, right. Where's Anzu?

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:51.450
Is she ever here?

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:10.000
I'll say you pass, but barely.

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:11.820
We did it!

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:12.750
Yeah!

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:17.480
Not to say you don't need a lot of work.

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:18.980
Great job, you guys.

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:20.920
Anya.

00:11:25.020 --> 00:11:26.140
Pozhaluysta.

00:11:29.030 --> 00:11:29.890
Thanks.

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:31.620
Th-Thank you!

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:32.670
...Um, I mean...

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:34.890
What was it in Russian?

00:11:34.890 --> 00:11:36.810
...U-Um...

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:45.660
Pozdravlyayu.

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:49.170
Congratulations.

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:51.890
You have all very worked hard.

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:55.560
Concert tomorrow surely will be beautiful.

00:11:57.090 --> 00:11:59.210
Did I say it right?

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:02.110
Yeah.

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:03.400
Yeah, yeah!

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:06.590
Thanks.

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:08.970
We'll do our best!

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:10.600
Oh, are these for us?

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:11.970
Yes, do take.

00:12:11.970 --> 00:12:12.890
Wow!

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:14.430
Thank you so much!

00:12:17.660 --> 00:12:20.720
Please study how the other
performers prepare and execute.

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:24.610
Today will be a valuable
experience for you all.

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:25.810
Yes!

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:32.910
I still can't accept it, but you beat meow
fair and square, so the stage is all yours!

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:36.020
Do your best on the stage!

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:38.840
We'll be watching with everyone.

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:41.460
Yes, we will!

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:45.720
We look forward to working with you!

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:48.720
Same here!

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:52.950
So this is what it's like
backstage at a concert?

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:55.220
It's not what you expected, right?

00:12:55.220 --> 00:12:58.700
...I was on staff for a play once, and—

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:58.950
Excuse me, girls. Come with me.

00:13:00.680 --> 00:13:03.280
Wow!

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:07.330
Introduce yourselves to the star performers.

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:12.420
W-We will be backup dancers today.

00:13:12.420 --> 00:13:13.880
I'm Shimamura Uzuki.

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:15.140
I'm Honda Mio!

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:17.250
I look forward to working with you today!

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:18.620
I'm Shibuya Rin.

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:20.230
I look forward to working with you.

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:22.210
And so do we!

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:25.570
Is this your first time on stage?

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:26.670
Y-Yes!

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:29.200
I-It's nerve-racking, isn't it?

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:32.310
...I've been shaking since this morning...

00:13:33.280 --> 00:13:34.550
Nice to meet you!

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:37.730
Let's burn up the concert hall
with flaming hot passion!

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:39.680
...Your first time on stage...

00:13:40.410 --> 00:13:42.080
How wonderful.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:45.860
If you have any questions, feel free to ask.

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:50.110
Oh? Didn't we meet the other day?

00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:52.450
Y-Yes! We did!

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:53.990
Seems we'll be working together today.

00:13:53.990 --> 00:13:55.740
Good morning!

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:56.530
Morning!

00:13:56.530 --> 00:13:58.280
Good morning!

00:13:58.280 --> 00:13:59.920
Let's burn it up!

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:00.940
You bet!

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:02.790
Yeah, yeah, yeah!

00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:07.180
Good morning.

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:09.300
Thank you for coming today.

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:13.230
Thank you for coming today.

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:24.180
...Um...

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:25.350
Which was "stage left" again?

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:28.590
Our left. The audience's right.

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:30.010
...Um...

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:33.890
"Stage left" is the audience's right,
...and "stage right" is the audience's left...

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:44.140
...That's loud...

00:14:44.140 --> 00:14:45.600
That scared me.

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:47.350
Mic test, please.

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:51.730
Got it! I'm Jougasaki Mika.
I look forward to working with you today.

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:53.520
Thank you, we're good.

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:56.220
After MC, lights out.
Exit stage right.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:01.740
They're different from our usual shoes.

00:15:01.740 --> 00:15:04.260
Might be dangerous if we don't get used to them.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:04.710
We're starting full rehearsal now!

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:06.020
O-Okay!

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:07.980
Watch your head!

00:15:09.240 --> 00:15:12.410
You'll be launched airborne
when it stops. Careful on the landing.

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:14.410
O-Okay!

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:14.410
Okay!

00:15:14.410 --> 00:15:17.430
Three, two, one.

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:28.300
Okay, stop!

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:33.520
One more time, from the top!

00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:34.730
Okay!

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:38.930
Um... Could we try one last time?

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:41.220
Sorry, we're already pushing the schedule.

00:15:42.470 --> 00:15:44.770
What do we do, Rin?

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:46.520
...I don't know...

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:50.070
We could probably practice the dance.

00:15:57.030 --> 00:16:00.950
Doors, people! Everyone backstage!

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:06.170
...Weird...

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:08.470
I've lost my appetite.

00:16:08.470 --> 00:16:09.300
Same.

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:17.220
Here's your change!

00:16:19.210 --> 00:16:20.260
Oh, here we are!

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:24.170
What? Up here?! Couldn't we sit closer?

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:28.630
But we can see <i>really far from 'ere!</i>

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:29.480
Right?

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:31.780
Oh, uh... Yeah.

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:37.640
It's going to be packed.

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:45.370
Let's see meow long they last!

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:47.750
Vsyo v poryadke.

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:58.840
Let's do this!

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:00.720
Yeah!

00:17:05.300 --> 00:17:06.850
My heart's about to burst.

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:07.990
It's starting!

00:17:07.990 --> 00:17:10.870
At long last, the Dark Tournament begins!

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:33.630
Looks like it's started, huh, Mio?

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:38.090
Mio?

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:38.800
Mio?

00:17:40.310 --> 00:17:41.300
Huh?

00:17:41.300 --> 00:17:43.620
You've been pretty quiet.

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:44.680
Are you okay?

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:46.810
H-Have I?

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:52.940
You're on standby.

00:17:53.430 --> 00:17:54.810
A-Already?

00:17:54.810 --> 00:17:56.070
Yup. Go get 'em!

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:08.120
Let's go.

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:11.380
...Y-Yeah...

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:12.880
Uzuki, let's go.

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:13.670
Huh?

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:14.880
Y-Yeah.

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:18.300
Don't worry.

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:19.640
We'll get it right.

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:20.510
Right.

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:21.470
Yeah.

00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:26.120
Awesome! Let's go!

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:27.000
Yeah!

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.480
'Sup girls?

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:29.790
How ya feelin'?

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:31.420
Ready to rumble?

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.860
Did you decide on your cheer
before heading out?

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:36.220
Ch-Cheer?

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:37.860
You should make one!

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:39.970
Like your favorite food!

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:40.790
...For me, it's...

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:43.580
Hot! Steamy! Rice!

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:49.550
Ch-Chocolate!

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:51.590
Prosciutto e melone!

00:18:51.590 --> 00:18:52.950
Fried chicken!

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:56.770
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:18:58.960 --> 00:18:59.970
All right!

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:03.280
Let's get out there and have some fun!

00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:06.210
Backups, standing by.

00:19:09.820 --> 00:19:10.770
Ready.

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.210
Five.

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:14.120
Four.

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:15.140
Three.

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:19.140
Fried chicken!

00:19:52.310 --> 00:19:53.560
Wow!

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:45.460
T!

00:20:46.020 --> 00:20:47.800
O!

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:49.280
K!

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:51.290
TOKIMEKI!

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:52.830
M!

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:54.580
E!

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:56.330
K!

00:20:56.330 --> 00:20:58.500
TOKIMEKI!

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:09.160
Thanks, you guys!

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:14.370
Now, I want to introduce my backup dancers!

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:16.230
They're still newbies,

00:21:16.230 --> 00:21:19.690
but I invited them, and they
agreed to go on stage with me!

00:21:21.390 --> 00:21:24.320
Let's ask them how it was.

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:26.070
Well?

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:29.600
...Um...

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:30.370
Yeah.

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:32.870
Yeah!

00:21:37.570 --> 00:21:39.700
Awesome!

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:49.540
That's the end of our show!

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:51.390
Good work, everyone!

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:00.030
Great work, guys!

00:22:00.030 --> 00:22:02.010
Totally awesome for your first time!

00:22:02.010 --> 00:22:04.300
Like, I knew you could pull it off!

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:05.810
Thank you very much!

00:22:05.810 --> 00:22:07.520
Thank you, Sis!

00:22:07.520 --> 00:22:09.070
Thank you very much.

00:22:11.530 --> 00:22:13.090
Great job out there.

00:22:13.090 --> 00:22:16.080
You set the house on fire!

00:22:16.080 --> 00:22:19.410
I'd call that a magnificent
first stage experience!

00:22:19.410 --> 00:22:22.500
I hope you can join us
for our next concert!

00:22:26.620 --> 00:22:28.220
Good work.

00:22:30.060 --> 00:22:31.050
Producer!

00:22:31.550 --> 00:22:33.620
...I, uh, wanted to say...

00:22:35.210 --> 00:22:39.180
Thank you so much for
letting us go on stage today!

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:42.560
You put on a good show.

00:22:45.730 --> 00:22:47.020
Mio!

00:22:48.470 --> 00:22:50.090
Rin!

00:22:50.090 --> 00:22:51.590
Shimamu!

00:22:52.780 --> 00:22:53.740
Shiburin!

00:22:53.030 --> 00:22:53.740
...Wai—

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:55.290
We did it!

00:22:55.290 --> 00:22:58.430
Our first time on stage was a success!

00:22:58.430 --> 00:23:00.780
Everything was, like, shining!

00:23:00.780 --> 00:23:02.890
Being an idol is so awesome!

00:23:02.890 --> 00:23:03.750
Yeah!

00:23:04.370 --> 00:23:06.410
Isn't it, Rin?

00:23:07.020 --> 00:23:08.260
Yeah.

00:23:10.970 --> 00:23:13.630
Good work today.

00:23:13.630 --> 00:23:17.260
Please try to make this experience your own.

00:23:17.740 --> 00:23:18.640
Okay!

00:23:18.980 --> 00:23:21.540
It was a truly amazing concert.

00:23:21.540 --> 00:23:24.020
To all the staff and performers,

00:23:24.020 --> 00:23:26.190
let's hold this success deep in our hearts,

00:23:26.190 --> 00:23:28.650
and make our next concert even better!

00:23:29.100 --> 00:23:31.630
...Hmph. Well, I guess you—

00:23:30.530 --> 00:23:32.780
You sparkled like'a Sun!

00:23:32.780 --> 00:23:34.580
Can I be in the next concert?

00:23:34.580 --> 00:23:36.090
I wanna be in it too!

00:23:36.090 --> 00:23:39.550
Let meow on stage too!

00:23:45.280 --> 00:23:48.550
Was it all... real?

00:23:49.650 --> 00:23:51.590
It was almost like a dream.

00:23:52.520 --> 00:23:53.280
Yeah.
